  "stem": "In a car race on straight road, car A takes a time ‘t’ less than car B at the finish and passes finishing point with a speed 'v' more than that of car B. Both the cars start from rest and travel with constant acceleration a<sub>1</sub> and a<sub>2</sub> respectively. Then 'v' is equal to:",
  "options": {
    "A": "$\\frac{a_{1} + a_{2}}{2}t$",
    "B": "$\\sqrt{2a_{1}a_{2}}$ t",
    "C": "$\\frac{2a_{1}a_{2}}{a_{1} + a_{2}}$ t",
    "D": "$\\sqrt{a_{1}a_{2}}$ t"
  },
  "answer": {
    "keys": [
      "D"
    ]
  },
